//Bases
//▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬
//Bonuses
//▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 NMAG !RW DIN RES>0]: %PURPLE%res %RES%%NL%%WHITE%%NAME%%CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 NMAG !RW DIN RES=0 EDAM>0]: %RED%ED %EDAM%%NL%%WHITE%%NAME%%CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 NMAG !RW WEAPON EDAM>0]: %RED%ED %EDAM%%NL%%WHITE%%NAME%%CONTINUE%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 NMAG !RW ARMOR EDEF>0 !(DIN (RES>0 OR EDAM>0))]: %BLUE%ED %EDEF%%NL%%WHITE%%NAME%%CONTINUE%


//EQUIPMENT
//▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

//Jewellery, Circlets and Quivers
//▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((jew OR rin OR amu OR CIRC) RARE !ID)]: %NAME%%MAP-0E%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((amu OR rin OR ram) UNI !ID)]: %ORANGE%ooooooo %GOLD%%NAME% %ORANGE%ooooooo%BORDER-D3%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((amu OR rin) SET !ID)]: %NAME%%MAP-7D%

//UNIQUE
//▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

//Armors
//▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

//Helms
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL=1 ((UNI !ID) cap)]: Biggin's Bonnet
ItemDisplay[(FILTLVL=2 OR FILTLVL=3) ((UNI !ID) cap)]: //Biggin's Bonnet
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) xap)]: %ORANGE%oooooo %GOLD%Peasant Crown %ORANGE%oooooo%MAP-D3%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) uap)]: %ORANGE%oooooooo %GOLD%Harlequin Crest %ORANGE%oooooooo%BORDER-D3%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) skp)]: Tarnhelm
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) xkp)]: %ORANGE%oooooo %GOLD%Rockstopper %ORANGE%oooooo%MAP-D3%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL=1 ((UNI !ID) hlm)]: Coif of Glory
ItemDisplay[(FILTLVL=2 OR FILTLVL=3) ((UNI !ID) hlm)]: //Coif of Glory
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) xlm)]: %ORANGE%oooooo %GOLD%Stealskull %ORANGE%oooooo%MAP-D3%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) ulm)]: %ORANGE%oooooooo %GOLD%Steel Shade %ORANGE%oooooooo%BORDER-D3%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL=1 ((UNI !ID) fhl)]: Duskdeep
ItemDisplay[(FILTLVL=2 OR FILTLVL=3) ((UNI !ID) fhl)]: //Duskdeep
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) xhl)]: %ORANGE%oooooo %GOLD%Darksight Helm %ORANGE%oooooo%MAP-D3%
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) uhl)]: %TAN%oooooooo %GOLD%Sage's Defiance / Overlord's Helm %TAN%oooooooo%BORDER-D3% //New
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL=1 ((UNI !ID) msk)]: The Face of Horror
ItemDisplay[(FILTLVL=2 OR FILTLVL=3) ((UNI !ID) msk)]: //The Face of Horror
ItemDisplay[FILTLVL>0 FILTLVL<4 ((UNI !ID) xsk)]: %ORANGE%oooooo %GOLD%Blackhorn's Face %ORANGE%oooooo%MAP-D3%
